{"duration_api_ms":7440,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"ecb0372f-6c8f-41ee-9811-4b526c40b6af","total_cost_usd":0.021656,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1101,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":642,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":55},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1101,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":642,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1101,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1101},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":642,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":1101,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.021656,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":55,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"# Ticket Classification & Routing: `user_a`\n\n**Query:** \"Customer cannot login because the account is locked and needs a password reset.\"\n\n## Classification\n| Field | Value |\n|---|---|\n| **category** | `account` (Account / Login) |\n| **Match basis** | The query contains the category keywords **account**, **login**, **locked**, and **password**. This also matches `default_category`. |\n\n## Routing Decision\n| Field | Value |\n|---|---|\n| **owner_team** | Account Support |\n\n## Priority & SLA\n| Field | Value |\n|---|---|\n| **priority** | P3 |\n| **sla** | 2 business days |\n\n## Policy Application\n**Policy:** \"Verify customer identity before changing account information or unlocking access.\"\n\nThe customer is asking for an unlock and a password reset, which is exactly the kind of access change this policy covers. **Do not unlock the account or issue reset credentials until identity verification succeeds.**\n\n## next_actions\n1. **Ask for identity verification.** This is a blocking step required by policy.\n2. **Check account lock status.** Only do this after identity is verified.\n3. **Provide password reset or unlock instructions.** Only do this after identity is verified.\n\n## Missing Information\nThe supplied data does not include the following, so none of it has been assumed:\n- **Verification status:** whether the customer's identity has already been verified.\n- **Verification method:** which identity checks are acceptable (for example, email code or security questions).\n- **Lock details:** the reason for the lock (such as failed attempts or a security flag) and the current lock status.\n- **Reset details:** the specific reset or unlock procedure, links, or tooling.\n- **Customer profile:** any tier or history for `user_a` that might change priority. None was provided, so the category default of P3 applies.","ttft_ms":2082,"type":"result","duration_ms":7477,"uuid":"a434b64c-bade-4db1-9725-c0ae580d841b","ttft_stream_ms":1382,"time_to_request_ms":35,"first_content_frame_ms":1382,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
